<event start="TLI_419" end="TLI_420">(0.24) </event>
<event start="TLI_420" end="TLI_421">dann brau/ bruk mer s bloß auseinanner ze machen. </event>
<event start="TLI_421" end="TLI_422">das ist jetz ???  </event>
<event start="TLI_422" end="TLI_423">(0.66) </event>
