<event start="TLI_424" end="TLI_425">(0.82) </event>
<event start="TLI_425" end="TLI_426">ich hon s schwer gehabt in dr Jugend. </event>
<event start="TLI_426" end="TLI_427">(0.6) </event>
<event start="TLI_431" end="TLI_432">eins, </event>
